---
// Features/Services section component
// Highlights the 4 main reasons to choose Century Digital
---

<section id="services" class="w-full bg-gray-50 scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
				Leads That Show Up Ready So You Can Close
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl self-center">
				You're good at closing. The problem is finding enough people who are ready. We built a system so you get qualified prospects delivered to you, not cold names. Same kind of pipeline the big players use, built for you.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
			<!-- Feature 1: AI Annuity Opportunity Finder -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🤖</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">We Find the Right People So You Don't Have To</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Our AI finds people 55–77, near or at retirement, with $100K+ ready to roll over and a recent life event that's got them thinking about annuities. So when a lead lands in your lap, the timing is already right. You just show up and close.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 2: Verified real people, opt-in -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🔐</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">Real People, Ready to Talk. No Cold Names.</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					We verify every prospect is a real person and get them to opt in before they ever reach you. So you're not wasting time on disconnected numbers or people who just wanted a free guide. You get people who've confirmed they have the assets and are in your wheelhouse. Your job is to close; we make sure the table is set.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 3: Exclusive, daily, state-licensed only -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">🎯</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">Your Pipeline. Your States. No Sharing.</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					Every prospect we send you is yours alone. We only send you people in the states you're licensed in, so you're not chasing leads you can't work or competing with another producer. You get a steady flow of qualified prospects. You do what you do best.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 4: Triggered so they're already thinking about annuities -->
			<div class="feature-box bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal group shadow-sm">
				<div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3b82f6] to-[#60a5fa] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-md">
					<span class="text-4xl">💡</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 gradient-text">They're Already Warm When You Get Them</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
					We don't dump cold names on you. We get these prospects thinking about annuities before they ever hit your list. So when you call, they're already in the right headspace. You're not selling from scratch; you're stepping into a conversation they're ready to have. That's why your close rate goes up.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="text-center">
			<a href="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/TkuYjNB6MiVU90uJMYJ4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-cta inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[220px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1e40af] to-[#1e293b] rounded-2xl text-xl font-semibold hover:from-[#1e3a8a] hover:to-[#0f172a] transition-all transform hover:scale-105 text-white">
				Book a Call →
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

